[31m-      <h2>Dashboard — Streamlit + Folium + Live Video</h2>[m
[31m-    </div>[m
[31m-[m
[31m-    <p>The dashboard is what judges will actually look at during the demo. It needs to do four things: show the live annotated drone feed, show the GPS map with pins appearing in real time, show the LLM report panel, and have a text input box for the defect query.</p>[m
[31m-[m
[31m-    <h3>Layout structure</h3>[m
