[31m-    <h1>Zero<em>Defect</em></h1>[m
[31m-    <div class="hero-tagline">India's Infrastructure, Inspected by AI — Not by Human Lives</div>[m
[31m-    <p class="hero-desc">[m
[31m-      India's bridges, flyovers, hospitals, dams, and industrial plants are inspected manually — by workers dangling from ropes, or not inspected at all. ZeroDefect deploys an autonomous drone with zero-shot AI vision and LLM reasoning to detect any structural defect a client describes in plain Hindi or English. No training data. No labeling. No delay. Just fly, describe, inspect.[m
