[31m-    <p>India's infrastructure inspection market is <strong>almost entirely undigitized</strong> — which means ZeroDefect is not competing against advanced technology. It's competing against clipboards and rope. The addressable market is enormous and the switching barrier is low because clients are not locked into any existing digital platform.</p>[m
