[31m-        <h3>Why government procurement is achievable</h3>[m
[31m-        <p style="font-size: 13px;">The Ministry of Road Transport and Highways (MORTH) in 2023 made it mandatory for bridges rated below 2 on the BHI scale to be inspected within 6 months. NHAI has a ₹2,500 crore annual maintenance budget. States like Maharashtra, Tamil Nadu, and Karnataka run independent bridge inspection programs. <strong>ZeroDefect can be positioned as the digital inspection tool for the Smart Cities Mission and PM Gati Shakti infrastructure programme.</strong> DPIIT's Startup India scheme provides government procurement access to registered startups — this is the go-to-market wedge.</p>[m
