[31m-      <div class="callout-text">[m
[31m-        <strong>Build in layers, not in sequence.</strong> The demo-winning core is: drone feed → Grounding DINO detection → boxes appear on dashboard map. Everything else (SAM 3, LLM reports, DINOv2, PDF export) is additive. Finish the core in Day 1. Polish and stack layers in Days 2–3. If hardware runs into issues, pre-captured footage on a laptop can carry the entire demo — judges care about the AI, not the drone flying in front of them.[m
